[32m+[m[32m                f"{COMMITS_REL}{hash_}-after.mp4",[m
[32m+[m[32m                "the change itself, paged in the terminal",[m
[32m+[m[32m                start=1,[m
[32m+[m[32m            )[m
[32m+[m[32m            what = "<p class=\"lede\">Ships nothing a terminal can run: the video is the diff.</p>"[m
